{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103730","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103730","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710373001:1":{"text":"여러분, 방금 그 말이 사실입니까? 고대의 전당 안에 마물이 나타났다고요?!","source_cn":"几位大人，你们刚刚说的事是真的吗？在圣古堂内遭遇了魔物？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8100198A84554AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710373002:1":{"text":"사실도 이런 사실이 없지요, 마물에게 포위되어 죽는 줄 알았지만... 제가... 크흠. 침착함을 잃지 않고 계속 다른 사람들을 격려했답니다!","source_cn":"真的不能再真了！我们被魔物包围了，本来以为死定了……但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6401CA5B12C6E7B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710373003:1":{"text":"오! 그게 무슨 말인가요, 타니스 백작? 그건 기적이었어요. 로란 대제님의 영령이었죠!","source_cn":"噢，闭嘴吧坦尼斯！是神迹！明明是罗兰大帝显灵了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5125D38038A3E55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710373004:1":{"text":"절망적인 순간에 로란 대제님의 영령이 칼리번으로 마물을 쓸어버리시고, 저희 모두를 그 끔찍한 곳에서 구해주셨답니다!","source_cn":"在那绝望的时刻，是罗兰大帝的英灵驾驭着石中剑，清除了魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23BF6636ACE43DC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710373005:1":{"text":"그... 카펠로 백작님, 잠시만요. 방금 모두라고 하셨는데... 이곳에는 세 분밖에 안 계십니다.","source_cn":"那个……卡佩洛伯爵，请等一下。您说大家都救回来了……可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0BA3234026C51B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710373006:1":{"text":"네에?!","source_cn":"什么？！<key:dialog4>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5CA5C1796507826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710373007:1":{"text":"페기 공주님은 어디 계신거죠? 다른 귀족분들은요?","source_cn":"佩吉公主呢？还有其他消失的贵族们呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA781CAF69728E33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710373008:1":{"text":"저, 저는 모르겠어요! 빛이 번쩍였을 때 공주님께서 분명 곁에 계셨는데...","source_cn":"我……我不知道！刚才光芒亮起的时候，公主就在附近啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3D9AA8881F57B2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710373009:1":{"text":"분명... 저희를 구하기 위해 칼리번을 뽑으러 달려가셨고...","source_cn":"她……她明明是为了救我们才冲上去拔剑的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE245B76306B4C92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710373010:1":{"text":"칼리번을요?! 공주님께서 칼리번을 뽑으셨나요?","source_cn":"冲上去拔剑？那结果呢？公主拔出石中剑了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAC10FFCFFCD401D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710373011:1":{"text":"...아쉽게도 칼리번은 공주님께 응답하지 않았습니다.","source_cn":"……很遗憾，那把剑并没有回应她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D042DD675F2C605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710373012:1":{"text":"그, 그 말은... 공주님께서 칼리번을 뽑지 못하셨다는 말인가요?!","source_cn":"没有回应？！您是说，公主殿下没能拔出石中剑？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x052F5198EAA3B7B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710373013:1":{"text":"직접 지켜본 사람으로서, 솔직하게 말해야겠지요...","source_cn":"作为亲历者，我必须诚实地陈述那一刻的事实——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x674EB98D449531BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710373014:1":{"text":"마물이 덮쳐오는 위기의 순간! 페기 공주님께서 칼리번을 뽑으려고 하셨습니다.","source_cn":"当魔物袭来，我们危在旦夕之时，佩吉公主殿下确实第一时间...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1C2518E1CB6CABC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710373015:1":{"text":"하지만... 공주님이 아무리 애써도, 왕권을 상징하는 칼리번은 꿈쩍도 하지 않았죠.","source_cn":"但……无论她如何努力，那柄象征着王权的石中剑都没因她而动摇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF44D8E38C6D8B23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710373016:1":{"text":"결국 칼리번이 스스로 검집에서 빠져나와, 신성한 빛으로 마물을 처치하고 저희를 돌려보내 준 겁니다.","source_cn":"最后，是剑自己出鞘，用神圣的光芒清除魔物，并将我们这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11F3A6E04E0D8480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710373017:1":{"text":"다른 사람들은... 여기에 없을 뿐, 저희처럼 돌아왔을 거예요. 그렇죠?","source_cn":"其他人、其他人一定跟我们一样回来了，只是没在一起……吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C94F60AF6AFB61B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:探听消息的记者":{"text":"정보를 캐묻는 기자","source":"探听消息的记者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伯爵坦尼斯":{"text":"타니스 백작","source":"伯爵坦尼斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:女伯爵卡佩洛":{"text":"카펠로 백작","source":"女伯爵卡佩洛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:好奇的民众":{"text":"호기심 많은 사람","source":"好奇的民众","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:报社主编伦道夫":{"text":"신문사 편집장 랜돌프","source":"报社主编伦道夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":5}}